        <div class="card" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem">Why is avocado relatively high in calories?</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Avocado is different from many other fruits because it contains a relatively high proportion of fat. Fat provides around 9 calories per gram, compared with about 4 calories per gram from carbohydrates and protein. This helps explain why avocado has more calories per 100g than fruit such as apples, oranges or strawberries.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Much of the fat in avocado is monounsaturated fat, including oleic acid, which is also found in foods such as olive oil. Avocado also provides fibre and a range of vitamins and minerals. Its calorie content does not make it inherently unhealthy; the amount you eat and your overall diet matter too.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.75rem;margin-top:1.25rem">Avocado calories compared with other fruits</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">Comparing calories per 100g is a useful way to see how avocado differs from other common fruits. The values below are approximate and may vary depending on the variety and ripeness.</p>
          <table style="width:100%;font-size:0.825rem;border-collapse:collapse">
            <tr style="background:var(--accent-light)">
              <th style="padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent)">Fruit</th>
              <th style="padding:0.6rem 0.75rem;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent)">Calories per 100g</th>
            </tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:0.5rem 0.75rem">🥑 Avocado</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>160 kcal</strong></td></tr>
            <tr style="background:var(--bg)"><td style="padding:0.5rem 0.75rem">🍌 Banana</td><td style="text-align:right">89 kcal</td></tr>
